-- Canonical localisation maps, Serre Sections 4 and 9 (agent L files).
-- SerreLambda instantiates the checked top-level lambda on a slice; the
-- chart ring fact, clearing/killing, finite products, naturality, pure
-- descent through the finite sheaf equaliser, ring localisation on a
-- principal affine cover, and the lambda-criterion supplying
-- SerreQuasiCoherent models. Openings are structural carriers and named
-- slice, scalar-restriction and chart maps, used by definition; no
-- localisation quotient, gluing or function-extensionality construction
-- is reopened; Trunc.carrier and Quot.Q appear only as carrier types.
